# skills: a boss takes blind. Gabryel alone at level 26 (level index 25 pinned, battle MP pinned to 50)
# in the Sasquatch fight (as test_skill_boss_venom.plan). Blinding Swipe (Right on the list), grid Right
# to Sasquatch (battler 9), A: cast (bb_00 to bb_23), MP 50 -> 43, status9 0 -> 2.
# Battle records at 0x0228E860 (0x6C each: status in the low nibble of +0x08, HP +0x14, MP +0x18, ATK +0x24, ATK stage +0x40). Run with --save.
include boot_from_save
pin u16 0x020B4724 999
pin u16 0x020B4720 999
pin u16 0x020B464C 2
pin u16 0x020B4650 65535
pin u16 0x020B4654 65535
pin u16 0x020B77EC 6
press Right 40
press Down,Right 40
press Right 40
press Down 80
wait 200
unpin
pin u16 0x020B4724 999
pin u16 0x020B4720 999
pin u16 0x020B464C 2
pin u16 0x020B4650 65535
pin u16 0x020B4654 65535
pin u32 0x020B471C 25
pinptr u32 0x020B8620 0x18 50
wait 30
poke u16 0x020B7838 1
poke u16 0x020B783A 1
poke u32 0x020B0010 0x73
waituntil u32 0x020B0010 7 3000
wait 120
battlers
peek u32 0x020B8620 records
watch u32 0x0228e878 gabryel_mp
watch u8 0x0228ebc8 status8
watch u8 0x0228ec34 status9
watch u8 0x0228eca0 status10
press A 8
wait 50
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
